		(property "Note" "REV 2.0: DNP. Duplicate I2C1 pull-up - the Pi 5 already pulls GPIO2/3 up with 1.8k, and R7+R9 in parallel give ~1.3k effective and ~2.5mA sink per line at VOL, more than any device on this bus needs. Earlier revisions of the spec explicitly said not to fit these. Footprint retained so it is a rework, not a respin, if bring-up measurement 6 (I2C rise times) says otherwise."
